ases 2019 (COVID-19), Severe Acute Respiratory Syndrome (SARS), Middle East Respiratory Syndrome (MERS), Influenza-Like Illness  (ILI), Respiratory Syncytial Virus (RSV)-related Acute Respiratory Infection (ARI), and Parainfluenza Virus type III (PIV3)-re
\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 l\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 ated ARI in Upper-Middle- Income Countries (UMIC), highlighting its major causes and comparing direct costs among nations. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 
