\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s15\qj \li322\ri0\sb139\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\nocwrap\nooverflow\faauto\rin0\lin322\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang1046\langfe1046\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\cgrid\langnp1046\langfenp1046 {
\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 Study design and registration
\par }\pard \ltrpar\s15\qj \fi707\li322\ri296\sb137\sl360\slmult1\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\nocwrap\nooverflow\faauto\rin296\lin322\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 
\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 The synthesize process will be based on the methodological process of a systematic review. To the best of our knowledge, there is no formal guideline to perform a systematic review of economic e
\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
valuations [4,7,9]. Thus, we will follow the well-established recommendations proposed in the Cochrane Handbook [10], but with some adaptations from studies performed by previously authors [4,7,9,11,12]. The main modifications included quality assessment 
\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 a\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 nd data analysis}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \expnd0\expndtw-2\lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 
\lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 process.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\s15\qj \fi707\li322\ri295\sb2\sl360\slmult1\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\nocwrap\nooverflow\faauto\rin295\lin322\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
This protocol is registered in the PROSPERO \hich\f1 \lquote \lquote \loch\f1 International Prospective Register of Systematic Reviews\hich\f1 \rquote \rquote \loch\f1 
 (CRD42020225757) and structured following the Preferred Reporting Items for Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis (PRISMA) Prot\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 ocols guidance [13].
\par }\pard \ltrpar\s15\ql \li0\ri0\sb11\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\nocwrap\nooverflow\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs35 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs35\lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\qj \li322\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\nocwrap\nooverflow\faauto\outlinelevel0\rin0\lin322\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
