\fs24\lang1046\langfe1046\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\cgrid\langnp1046\langfenp1046 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
If a same study, using the same sample and methods, is found in different published reports (e.g. abstract in congress, study protocol, and full- text article), all of them will be included, but analyzed as a unique study. If differ
\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
ent studies in a same population, with the same viral ARI investigated, are found completing overlapping time horizons, the report with the smaller period of analysis will be excluded. If a similar situation occurs without the temporal superposition, both
\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1  \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 reports will be included and analyzed as different}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \expnd-4\expndtw-20\lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 
\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 studies.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\s15\ql \li0\ri0\sb1\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\nocwrap\nooverflow\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs33 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs33\lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 
