\hich\f1 , \'93\loch\f1 \hich\f1 no\'94\loch\f1 \hich\f1 , and \'93\loch\f1 \hich\f1 not applicable\'94\loch\f1 . At the end of the classification, a relative value of each of these grades is settled for each study. The goa\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 l
\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1  is to check the percentages of "yes" for each question [9].
