\b\fs24\lang1046\langfe1046\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\cgrid\langnp1046\langfenp1046 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 Summary measures and synthesis of results

\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s15\qj \fi707\li322\ri297\sb140\sl360\slmult1\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\nocwrap\nooverflow\faauto\rin297\lin322\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
\fs24\lang1046\langfe1046\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\cgrid\langnp1046\langfenp1046 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
Due to the expected heterogeneity of the investigated topic in terms of design, study object, setting, methodological perspective and other characterist\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
ics, a quantitative synthesis of the burden estimates is unlikely to be appropriate. Thus, the results of included studies will be interpreted qualitatively in a narrative synthesis.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\s15\qj \fi707\li322\ri295\sl360\slmult1\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\nocwrap\nooverflow\faauto\rin295\lin322\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
The main aspect of aggregation will be the type of viral ARI: COVID-19, S\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
ARS, MERS, ILI, RSV-related ARI, or PIV3-related ARI. We will then focus on the overall economic burden of the diseases on health systems and population; total direct cost; the contribution of different cost components to the economic burden (e.g. pharmac
\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 o\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
logical therapy, hospitalization); comparative assessments of costs analysis across geographical location and time horizon; and current research gaps. Moreover, we intend to identify, when presented, prevalence and incidence rates of each disease. We will
\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1  \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 follow the PRISMA statement and checklist to undertake and report the findings of our systematic review [13].
\par }\pard \ltrpar\s15\ql \li0\ri0\sb1\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\nocwrap\nooverflow\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs36\lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\qj \li322\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\nocwrap\nooverflow\faauto\outlinelevel0\rin0\lin322\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\fs24\lang1046\langfe1046\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\cgrid\langnp1046\langfenp1046 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 Discussion and study limitations
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s15\qj \fi707\li322\ri294\sb137\sl360\slmult1\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\nocwrap\nooverflow\faauto\rin294\lin322\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
\fs24\lang1046\langfe1046\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\cgrid\langnp1046\langfenp1046 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
There are some goals that we believe that our systematic review may achieve. Firstly, we will present the economic burden viral ARI to health systems, patients, and even society. If possible, we would like to report how these cost impacts on GDP of countr
\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 i\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 es, aiming to present data to support the development of programs to respond to viral ARI.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\s15\qj \fi707\li322\ri295\sl360\slmult1\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\nocwrap\nooverflow\faauto\rin295\lin322\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
When comparing and identifying major costs drives related to a viral ARI in different countries with sociodemographic similarities, we expect to point out perspectiv\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
es and actions that may or may not have worked successfully. The same expectation is applicable to analyze different time horizons}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \expnd10\expndtw51\lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 
\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 in the same
\par \sect }\sectd \ltrsect\linex0\headery54\footery0\sectdefaultcl\sftnbj \pard\plain \ltrpar\s15\qj \li322\ri295\sb82\sl362\slmult1\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\nocwrap\nooverflow\faauto\rin295\lin322\itap0 \rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
\fs24\lang1046\langfe1046\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\cgrid\langnp1046\langfenp1046 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
country. These lessons may inform decision-makers and researchers to support formulation\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1  and refinement of policy and research objectives in viral ARI.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\s15\qj \fi707\li322\ri296\sl360\slmult1\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\nocwrap\nooverflow\faauto\rin296\lin322\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
We anticipate some limitations in our study related to bias in viral ARI reporting and estimating burden of the diseases. As COVID-19 is an emerging public health concern, with many topics sti\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
ll under discovery, we may encounter a lack of studies or incomplete analysis with dubious results. We intend to overcome these limitations with a sensible analysis of the quality and relevance of included studies, and a further update of this systematic 
\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 r\hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 eview two years after the first publication.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\s15\qj \fi707\li322\ri294\sl360\slmult1\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\nocwrap\nooverflow\faauto\rin294\lin322\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1033\langfe1046\langnp1033\insrsid15221459\charrsid8994339 \hich\af1\dbch\af31505\loch\f1 
